{
    "title": "Role Swap: Tricky Puzzle",
    "description": "As the tricky puzzle game, Role swap dares you to unravel clever puzzle that will bend and trick your mind. Each level presents a unique challenge, requiring you to think outside the box and devise ingenious solutions. Can you piece together the perfect sequence of events that lead to a joyous outcome?\r\nThe gameplay of Role swap is both fun and addictive. Your objective is simple: put your creativity to the test and conjure up the most hilarious, surprising, and satisfying endings. With every tap and drag, you become the mastermind behind the happiness of your characters. Witness their delight and excitement as your scenarios come to life before your eyes!\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Play with a cast of different characters and watch them interact based on how you build their stories.\r\n\u2022 Swap characters and settings to create a ton of surprises and happy conclusions.\r\n\u2022 Unlock secret achievements and hidden endings.\r\n\u2022 Complete the game to become the finest storyteller in the land!",
    "descriptionHTML": "As the tricky puzzle game, Role swap dares you to unravel clever puzzle that will bend and trick your mind. Each level presents a unique challenge, requiring you to think outside the box and devise ingenious solutions. Can you piece together the perfect sequence of events that lead to a joyous outcome?<br>The gameplay of Role swap is both fun and addictive. Your objective is simple: put your creativity to the test and conjure up the most hilarious, surprising, and satisfying endings. With every tap and drag, you become the mastermind behind the happiness of your characters. Witness their delight and excitement as your scenarios come to life before your eyes!<br>Features:<br>\u2022 Play with a cast of different characters and watch them interact based on how you build their stories.<br>\u2022 Swap characters and settings to create a ton of surprises and happy conclusions.<br>\u2022 Unlock secret achievements and hidden endings.<br>\u2022 Complete the game to become the finest storyteller in the land!",
